{
  "faithful": "Suppose that, by the restraint imposed upon the liberty of the press, all censure of the government is forbidden; here is undoubtedly a choice. The government, in this case, virtually says, the people who might attempt the task of directing the public mind are of two sorts; one, those who would censure; another, those who would not censure; I choose the latter.",
